{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":12654,"chapterID":114,"chapterNumber":"11","sectionNumber":"1101.6","title":"1101.6 Fittings and connections.","sourceHTMLPath":"code-sections/plumbing-code/chapters/Chapter 11.html","blocks":[{"id":"12654-html-1","kind":"html","html":"</div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163364\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163364\"></AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">All connections and changes in direction of the storm drainage system shall be made with approved drainage-type fittings in accordance with </span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"><Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-162668', hash: '#JD_PCTable706.3' }}\">Table 706.3</Link></span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">. The fittings shall not obstruct or retard flow in the system.</span></div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>","plainText":"All connections and changes in direction of the storm drainage system shall be made with approved drainage-type fittings in accordance with Table 706.3 . The fittings shall not obstruct or retard flow in the system."}]}
